                  "status": "Open",
                  "severity": "High",
                  "type": "Information Disclosure",
                  "description": "Database records containing appointment and patient details may be exposed if access controls are bypassed or DB credentials are compromised.",
                  "mitigation": "Enforce least privilege for DB accounts, protect credentials, and apply row-level access checks.",
